   "tags": "Technical • CIVIL ENGINEERING • +1 / -0",
   "html": "<p>A steel section is subjected to a combination of shear and bending action. The applied shear force is V and shear capacity of the section is <em>V<sub>d</sub></em>. For such a section, if it is case of high shear (as per IS 800 : 2007), then choose the TRUE statement(s).</p>",
